EXCEPTION — bundled amiibo database

`web/data/amiibo-db.js` is a generated file. Its amiibo *name* table is derived
from solosky/pixl.js (`fw/application/src/amiidb/db_amiibo.c`), which is
licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2. That generated file is
therefore distributed under the GPL-2.0, whose full text is in
`LICENSE.GPL-2.0`, not under the MIT terms above. Its series and type labels and
release dates come from N3evin/AmiiboAPI (and the 8bitDream fork), MIT-licensed.

The MIT license above covers all other source in this repository.

amiibo, character, and game names and artwork are the property of Nintendo and
their respective owners. This project bundles none of that artwork and no amiibo
data; see the README for details.
